- ⛔ 회수 필요: parent must capture customer/operator × light/dark × 1440/1024/390 and run computed contrast, visible focus and all interactive-target rectangles on the newest retake.
- ⛔ 회수 필요: the independent product-design reviewer must rerun M09/M13/M14 after that evidence. Review v3 already resolves M01–M08 and M10–M12; its B/NO-GO cannot be self-overridden.
