- Material 3 states: retained distinct loading/empty/partial/permission/uncertain/repair states and visible outcomes.

### Red team and self-question

Demanding customer attack: “Hiding IDs makes support and audit unreliable.” The retake does not delete or mutate them; it separates machine identity from customer presentation. Support/debug can inspect exact immutable attributes, while customers identify the same record by title, revision, channel, time and status.

Skeptical reviewer attack: “A textContent regex misses an ID in an accessible label or form.” The audit includes form values, `aria-label`, title and alt across routes, steps, dialogs, recovery before/after, source states, Settings8, video lifecycle and customer matrix combinations.

이 결론이 틀렸다면 가장 그럴듯한 이유는? 긴 human-readable labels could create new visual density or wrapping at 390px even with semantic tests green. Therefore this retake reports a closure candidate, preserves v4 browser evidence without overstating it, and requires final independent visual-language review.

