- ⛔ 회수 필요: independent reviewer must rerun the exact M14 customer-default sweep and issue the governing grade.
- Product-wiki/campaign/result/learning persistence and external OAuth/publish/analytics remain plan/engineering/QA gaps already recorded; this design retake does not expand their scope.

Next stage possible: **NO until independent M14 re-review; design evidence is ready.**

